:"房之秀道韞所著詩賦誄頌並傳於世"}]},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun-wyd","book_id":"b-jinshu-096","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-096-daoyun-wyd1916"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004","text":"初，同郡張玄妹亦有才質，適於顧氏，玄每稱之，以敵道韞。有濟尼者，游於二家，或問之，濟尼答曰：「王夫人神情散朗，故有林下風氣。顧家婦清心玉映，自是閨房之秀。」道韞所著詩賦誄頌並傳於世。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"張玄","person_id":"ce4_5fc_839","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:u0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"顧氏","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"夫姓顧，未記名，不以同時的顧敷代入。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"玄","person_id":"ce4_5fc_839","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按相連人名、語法及所行之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"道韞","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CE","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"濟尼","person_id":"1em_pr8_0yh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:u0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"或","person_id":null,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"向濟尼問兩家婦人者未具名。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"濟尼","person_id":"1em_pr8_0yh","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"顧家婦","person_id":"ge6_59v_z4y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按同段姓名及其所任、所述之事。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-096-xiedaoyun:p004:m0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"道韞","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CE","kind":"per